1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,880
Bulk import brings a whole portfolio into
Miftah in one step,

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:07,761
which suits onboarding a new organisation
or moving from another system.

3
00:00:07,761 --> 00:00:10,230
As a Company Admin, open Properties and

4
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:12,347
Units, then More, then Import Portfolio.

5
00:00:12,347 --> 00:00:16,227
Always start from a fresh template: select
Download Template, so the

6
00:00:16,227 --> 00:00:19,755
columns and accepted values match the
version you are running.

7
00:00:19,755 --> 00:00:22,224
The workbook has a sheet each for

8
00:00:22,224 --> 00:00:24,341
properties, units, tenants, and tenancy
contracts.

9
00:00:24,341 --> 00:00:27,516
Keep the column headings as they are, and
make

10
00:00:27,516 --> 00:00:30,691
every unit name a property from the
Properties sheet.

11
00:00:30,691 --> 00:00:34,218
Upload a copy with mistakes first, to see
what happens.

12
00:00:34,218 --> 00:00:37,040
Choose the file and select Upload and
Import.

13
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:40,215
Miftah checks the whole workbook before it
creates anything.

14
00:00:40,215 --> 00:00:44,449
Validation Failed lists each problem with
its sheet, row, column, and cause.

15
00:00:44,449 --> 00:00:47,623
Row three has a unit type that is not

16
00:00:47,623 --> 00:00:50,446
on the list, and row five names a

17
00:00:50,446 --> 00:00:53,268
property that is not in the Properties
sheet.

18
00:00:53,268 --> 00:00:54,326
Nothing was created.

19
00:00:54,326 --> 00:00:57,148
Fix the mistakes in the workbook itself,
then

20
00:00:57,148 --> 00:00:59,970
select Try Again and upload the corrected
copy.

21
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:02,440
Keep the window open while it runs,

22
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:04,556
and upload a workbook only once.

23
00:01:04,556 --> 00:01:07,026
Import Successful shows the counts: one
property,

24
00:01:07,026 --> 00:01:09,495
two buildings, four units, and two
tenants.

25
00:01:09,495 --> 00:01:11,611
This workbook has no tenancy contracts.

26
00:01:11,611 --> 00:01:12,670
Close the dialog.

27
00:01:12,670 --> 00:01:15,845
Oasis Crest Garden Villas is now in the
list.

28
00:01:15,845 --> 00:01:17,609
Select Manage and open Units.

29
00:01:17,609 --> 00:01:20,783
All four units are there, each in the
building

30
00:01:20,783 --> 00:01:23,606
the workbook named, vacant, with its
expected rent.

31
00:01:23,606 --> 00:01:24,311
Open Tenants.

32
00:01:24,311 --> 00:01:27,486
Omar Al Mansoori and Leila Farouk have
joined the

33
00:01:27,486 --> 00:01:30,661
list, ready to be chosen for a tenancy
contract.

34
00:01:30,661 --> 00:01:32,777
Imported tenants get no portal invitation;

35
00:01:32,777 --> 00:01:34,894
the next tutorial covers portal access.

36
00:01:34,894 --> 00:01:37,363
For later changes, edit records one at

37
00:01:37,363 --> 00:01:39,480
a time rather than importing again.
